{"schema":1,"revision":92022659,"page":{"pageid":602448,"title":"棉花糖","displayTitle":"棉花糖","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"noteTA-f3e2a619\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"IT\"></div></div></div>\n<p><b>棉花糖</b>可能指：\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%96_(%E6%A3%89%E7%B5%AE%E7%8B%80)\" title=\"棉花糖 (棉絮狀)\">棉花糖 (棉絮狀)</a>，將砂糖經加熱後融解成的糖漿製成。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96\" title=\"棉花軟糖\">棉花軟糖</a>，以玉米糖漿或麥芽糖糖漿、明膠及阿拉伯膠製成的糖果，呈顆粒狀。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%96_(%E9%9F%B3%E4%B9%90%E4%BA%BA)\" title=\"棉花糖 (音樂人)\">棉花糖 (音樂人)</a>，美國電子舞曲製作人和 DJ。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A3%89%E8%8A%B1%E7%B3%96_(%E7%BB%84%E5%90%88)\" title=\"棉花糖 (組合)\">棉花糖 (組合)</a>，台灣的一個獨立流行組合。</li></ul>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r94540867\">.mw-parser-output .dmbox{display:flex;align-items:center;clear:both;margin:0.9em 1em;border-top:1px solid #ccc;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;padding:0.25em 0.35em;font-size:small}.mw-parser-output .dmbox>*{flex-shrink:0;margin:0 0.25em}.mw-parser-output .dmbox-body{flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;padding:0.1em 0}.mw-parser-output .dmbox-invalid-type{text-align:center}</style>\n<div role=\"note\" id=\"disambigbox\" class=\"metadata plainlinks dmbox dmbox-disambig\" style=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_gray.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"消歧義圖示\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnai